<spell-notebook "modal theming">
	<header level="1">
		Modal
		<header>A modal displays content that temporarily blocks interactions with the main view of a
              site.</>
	</>
	<modal-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<html>
			<ui-menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
				<ui-item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
				<ui-item link="#themes">Themes</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme with the public `--ui-modal-*` tokens: set one on the element, on any ancestor (`:root` for every modal),
			or on the box through `::part(modal)`. They inherit into the shadow root, where the sheet reads each through a
			private alias, so nothing inside blocks them.

			- `--ui-modal-dimmer-background` colours the backdrop (by default the shared `--ui-dimmer-background`, which also
			  themes `<ui-dimmer>`); `--ui-modal-dimmer-filter` filters it (`blur(5px) grayscale(0.7)` for Fomantic's blurring
			  dimmer).
			- A `--ui-modal-width` holds on every screen; `fullscreen` replaces it.
			- The header, content and actions parts read `--ui-modal-header-*`, `--ui-modal-content-background` and
			  `--ui-modal-actions-background` from the modal, so set those on the modal or above it; the `basic` look replaces them.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			/* every modal on the page */
			:root {
			  --ui-modal-radius: 0.75em;
			}
			/* one kind:  a narrower box on a darker, blurred dimmer */
			ui-modal.confirm {
			  --ui-modal-width: 480px;
			  --ui-modal-dimmer-background: oklch(0 0 0 / 0.6);
			  --ui-modal-dimmer-filter: blur(5px) grayscale(0.7);
			}
			```
		</>
		<message state="info" size="small">
			<markdown>
				Sizes are widths, ratios of the default width (`--ui-modal-width`: 95%, tablets 88%, then 850px / 900px /
				950px by screen); the text does not scale. Never set the `--_ui-modal-*` names: they're the sheet's private
				plumbing.
			</>
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-modal" playground>
				<button type="button" class="ui button" commandfor="modal-types-standard-playground" command="--show">Show</>
				<ui-modal id="modal-types-standard-playground" closable>
					<ui-header>Profile Picture</>
					<ui-content>
						<ui-description>
							<p>We've found the following gravatar image associated with your e-mail address.</>
							<p>Is it okay to use this photo?</>
						</>
					</>
					<ui-actions>
						<ui-button class="deny" color="black">Nope</>
						<ui-button class="approve" color="positive">Yep, that's me</>
					</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
